rows.paper_statement:
\begin{assumption}[Augmentation requires a foothold]
\label{ass:foothold}
For unfamiliar languages with skill $\underline{s}$,
$\gamma\underline{s}-r_C\le0$. For familiar languages with skill $\bar{s}$,
$\gamma\bar{s}-r_C>0$.
\end{assumption}

